  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Oil for Development Programme Phase 3 Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Programme is to ensure sustainable management of petroleum resources and hence contribute to reduction of poverty. To achieve these results, the OfD Programme provides capacity development to the Lebanese Petroleum Administration (LPA) and to other relevant stakeholders in Lebanon, notably the Ministry of Finance (MoF) and the Ministry of Environment (MoE). The parliament, civil society and the media also receive support.</narrative>
  </description>
